<title>JAPAN: Vietnam issues spot tender for Feb Bach Ho crude.</title>
<headline>Vietnam issues spot tender for Feb Bach Ho crude.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam has invited bids for sales of Bach Ho crude oil for lifting in the second half of February, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bids must be placed by January 8 and are valid until January 10, they said.</p>
<p>Vietnam said it was offering 450,000 barrels in the tender.</p>
<p>Traders said Vietnam occasionally places sales tenders.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Energy Desk +81 3 5473 3706</p>
